  "details": "With the addition of Loading Screen Customisations, adding a feature to hide Information and Tips during loading would be nice.\n\nThis could be done manually on each tip card to \"Do not show this again\", ensuring new tips will still be shown or as a whole \"Do not show Info Boxes\" option.\n\nEspecially with the new Old Loading Screen, the boxes block the view of the great and vast space of VRChat.\n\nI attached an image of what I mean by Information/Tips boxes.",
